[{"client_msg_id":"5066e585-83d4-4ea6-aff1-1f718c29c441","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ありがとうございます、期待した動作になりました。","ts":"1634220653.349400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tada","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ugO4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"73a33c8c-344e-404b-b5e3-9f82b801db54","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ありがとうございます、試してみます。","ts":"1634219994.348600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Jn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd0ab084-1ce4-430d-aeb1-3b1c0d315107","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これのNoteの部分かな？","ts":"1634219938.348000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xhGH"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *pum#open()*\npum#open({startcol}, {items})\n                Open popup menu like |complete()|.\n                {startcol} is the byte offset in the line where the completed\n                text start.\n                {items} must be a |List|.  See |complete-items| for the kind\n                of items.  You can use following special key.\n \n                        highlights:  Custom highlights.\n                                type     \"abbr\" or \"kind\" or \"menu\"\n                                name    highlight name.  It is used for\n                                        |prop_type_add()| in Vim.\n                                        Note: It must be unique.\n                                hl_group        highlight group\n                                (|highlight-groups|)\n                                col     highlight start column (0 origin)\n                                width   highlight end column width\n                        Note: It is experimental feature.\n \n                Note: If 'completeopt' contains \"noinsert\", the first item is\n                selected automatically, but it increases screen flicker.\n```","ts":"1634219928.347700","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9f97883b-ffed-4097-830d-a96c683abad4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h pum#open()","ts":"1634219928.347600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"icl2"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"Update success: Shougo/pum.vim (8473ece =\u0026gt; 14c75de)","ts":"1634219922.347300","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fc07575e-1f29-4bab-a9aa-58c7894a287d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":vimhelp plugin update Shougo/pum.vim","ts":"1634219921.347200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MTHV9"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                        *pum#open()*\npum#open({startcol}, {items})\n                Open popup menu like |complete()|.\n                {startcol} is the byte offset in the line where the completed\n                text start.\n                {items} must be a |List|.  See |complete-items| for the kind\n                of items.\n                Note: If 'completeopt' contains \"noinsert\", the first item is\n                selected automatically, but it increases screen flicker.\n```","ts":"1634219891.346500","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"38cd7191-0e88-4c44-b0fd-73e98174619f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":h pum#open()","ts":"1634219891.346400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UEj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"74319285-a16d-434d-a555-46c58455e302","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"ddc+pum でポップアップメニューが自動表示された際、表示直後に最初の項目が選択されるでしょうか？\n元々そういう動作なのか、意図しない動作なのかわからなかったもので。\n最初の項目が選択されていると、その項目を入力するには pum#map#confirm() が必要だと思うので、選択されていない状態から pum#map#insert_relative(+1) ができればなと思いまして。\n（設定の意味を理解せずそのような動作になるような設定をしているのかも）","ts":"1634219769.346000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"piwO5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0feaa0e6-6ca0-4903-819d-a5e3d244a7a2","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"sourceの仕様は決まらないものの、とりあえずsyncとして進めることはできるだろうし","ts":"1634215899.341500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O=VF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8335e487-5b03-49fb-8c0e-7e44977c3a55","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"ddu.vimの設計や実装をそろそろやるべきかなぁ","ts":"1634215869.340500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":3,"users":["U01HFNMNB55","U9S4G0LJW","U02G79NJMLY"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tM6NI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84e9e012-9754-4e38-89c8-bae0ff9de248","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"このまま使ってみます。","ts":"1634194490.330900","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"irj"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"2a6daecd-647f-46be-bb0b-dff062ef96b0","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"\u003c@U72TB62UF\u003e さんとかcoc-ddcの人柱になってくれそうな気がしてる","ts":"1634174325.324600","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","reply_count":47,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lBp"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"1595d929-9d2f-4323-abb7-d99f80a44f82","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"Windowsのgvimでcoc-ddcを動かしたところ、それっぽく動いているようです。\n気になった点としては、候補を選択するとき、 カーソルキーの上下だと補完メニューでの選択はできますが、Enterを押下しても内容が入力されな