-26c1-4614-b4a9-cafe36138522","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"確認しましたが、ここはbatchを使ってるので問題ありません","ts":"1634182870.330100","thread_ts":"1634178388.329600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jRhO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"328b6e6c-fb18-45f9-8416-5337402b8e89","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そうなんですね\n了解です","ts":"1634183671.330300","thread_ts":"1634178388.329600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n6x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1da07b9-267a-4d23-98f2-123b7d41f30f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"今publishしたのでCocInstall coc-ddcで入ります","ts":"1634176575.325700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h2a39"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0b2cf0f-ff2c-4671-9871-45ccf144eee5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ddcを更新して昨日追加された\n`call ddc#custom#patch_global('completionMenu', 'none')`\nしてください","ts":"1634176602.325900","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1634176707.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yvu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d878de3-2441-4ef2-85fb-7805a9bb7d40","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"手順としては、\n\n• cocとddcを両方インストールする\n• CocInstall coc-ddc\n• vimrcに call ddc#custom#patch_global('completionMenu', 'none') をセット\nで動く感じでしょうか。\n\nまた、ddcの設定は残したままで良い？（各種ddc用のプラグインを動かすため）","ts":"1634176782.327300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","edited":{"user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1634176807.000000"},"parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m4uxW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf596ef6-4989-4c04-8258-e720c4288bd1","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"残さないと動かないですね、候補取ってくるだけなんでsorterとかmatcherは動作しないです","ts":"1634176805.327500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"caBAw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f02f35b4-1936-4490-bb93-2c5480e43bc4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとはその手順で動くはずです","ts":"1634176825.327800","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NJgs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ae0e19d-44f9-4c86-9e85-a534a4f374eb","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"了解です。午前中は取り込んでいるため、午後に試します","ts":"1634176842.328000","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oKD=5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79b5f5af-29e1-447f-a0a9-d4370a9f1297","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あれ、マジか・・・","ts":"1634194508.331300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vJ9wn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d963ad07-1100-4ab3-b9b5-328fb3f608b4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"その辺はcocの補完の仕様だと思うけど、なんかいじらないといけないのかな","ts":"1634194555.331500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FJS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dfd3c00-041b-4ddc-a9e3-d63cd451a2c7","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"cocの設定もあれこれしているので衝突している可能性はありそうです。","ts":"1634194618.331700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rmp9="}]},{"client_msg_id":"110ef99a-639b-444a-8bbd-1f6057f52c4c","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"実用は問題ないかと。","ts":"1634194627.331900","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AR=7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7828dc6e-d048-482b-8dc1-1a0e977cbfb5","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"これでcocはlspとcoc-listをのみを使えて、補完はddcに任せる分担ができそうですねー。","ts":"1634195040.332100","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k7G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"877d0a98-bd94-4b5c-abc9-c8202c990dac","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どうだろう、ddcを使った方がmatcherとかsorterが使えるので、coc-ddcだけを使うには恩恵が微妙かなって気はしてるんですよね","ts":"1634195084.332300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RxL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fca2343-a022-43ed-918a-b06f0d0827aa","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"cocの方がTSの自動importとかいろいろ恩恵がある部分もあるので、自分は併用しそうです","ts":"1634195115.332500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K5=xp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c021d901-dd2a-4c0c-bd76-c27729b9d73a","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"自分はcoc-fzfをヘビーに使っているので、ddcのsorかterやmatcherの利益を無視してもメリットがある感じです。","ts":"1634195187.332700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe1170b7-0920-49ec-9671-13dd5e1a9815","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"そもそもcocそのものの補完も悪いわけではありませんし","ts":"1634195206.332900","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l7x0+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad7d1248-dc92-4871-baf3-33057f64ab6d","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"coc-format, coc-renameとかを使えるのがありがたいです。","ts":"1634195260.333100","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dD1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"90e2b3ea-ed32-4517-9429-2711dfe4f6f4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"完全に関係ない話なんですけどcoc-fzfってどの辺が便利なんでしたっけ","ts":"1634195262.333300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ivR/X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7acd138e-defc-434e-ae1a-ca019bcbec8c","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"九割がたoutlineしか使ってないのですが、これが一番精度が高い。\nvistaでもそれっぽいことはできるのですが絞込ができなかったり、Denite outlineはctags由来でアウトラインを出すので、自動化できるとは言えctagsの更新が必要など面倒差があるのですが、coc-fzfは入れただけで精度が高いアウトラインが出る＆プレビューと絞込ができると、便利なところが大きいです。","ts":"1634195480.333500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kVPbR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63c75d1d-aac2-4ec4-8ec4-5c362129e1bb","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"理解、outlineならfzf-previewでもできそうだけど","ts":"1634195541.333700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"knX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1192e952-3f54-4887-ae69-dee503bf0409","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、できそうっていうのは実装はできそうって意味です","ts":"1634195580.334000","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U72TB62UF","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L3Efm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04a10c03-8bbf-459e-9b65-ca76211b7c2f","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"`autocmd FileType * let b:coc_suggest_disable = 1` で補完を無効にしてddcを使うのと、どっちがいいんだろう。","ts":"1634195698.334300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wsod"}]},{"client_msg_id":"592b600d-4fcf-4db0-ad51-99e593164474","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"自分はcocレベルでの自動importとかが便利なのでcoc使うつもりです","ts":"1634195764.334500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"25xd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6469f155-344e-42fa-a9f2-43e9267ca98c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ddcに寄せるとLSもcoc + vim-lspとかにしないといけなくなりません？","ts":"1634195809.334700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nwgi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"969756a5-fb89-4773-95c4-5b67b1fe0062","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"ycinoさんはtypescript書くのがめっちゃ多いでしょうから,cocのほうがメリット大きそうですね。","ts":"1634195813.334900","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UeVI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee778a00-1ea4-4280-9adb-23cb2c5a32e4","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"LSの補完その他を全部捨てれるならddc使うだけでもよさそう","ts":"1634195842.335100","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fjce"}]},{"client_msg_id":"902961e8-78a0-4050-9653-687798d5cbd7","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"自分はアウトラインでの関数ジャンプをめっちゃ使うので、ddcに寄せるなら移行先を探すなり作るなりする必要がありますねえ。","ts":"1634195848.335300","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vObX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98a7f1f5-0e0f-470c-a656-7df51f759690","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"なんだかんだ、適当に入れるだけでかなり使えるようになるcocは強い","ts":"1634195872.335500","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rH79F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"462065cf-8297-4695-8e41-0a705ff869cd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"まぁTSも含めてLSクライアントとしてcocが優秀なので・・・","ts":"1634195898.335700","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U72TB62UF"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zrD6X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d59afcc2-f1bd-461f-8876-e3066960a0e2","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ddc-vim-lsp入れるとかになるとLSもcoc + vim-lspとかになって死んじゃいません？","ts":"1634195936.336000","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sH6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"088f551c-a8f0-46e8-9cd9-332bc7b2310f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"LS + ddc + coc使うならcoc-ddc使わざるを得なくなる気がする","ts":"1634195968.336400","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hs2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60426755-efb6-48dd-bd6d-0b0005db5c36","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"それがあるんですよね…この補完はddc、この補完はcocという二重管理展開になる","ts":"1634195984.336600","thread_ts":"1634174325.324600","parent_user_id":"U8996GYBF","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iDQ+J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7e45f2a-0bb3-45a8-ac92-ef269ded